    "adaptation": "Demon Beast 1 is a reviewed visual adaptation for the bounded canonical Dretch, not a vendor identification. Native bite/critical/claw gestures map to Attack 1/2/3; there is no ranged mapping. Fifteen meaningful 128 px columns, eight visually reviewed E, SE, S, SW, W, NW, N, NE rows. The PNG-only package declares no FPS/pivot. 12 fps and support pixel (64,83), origin_y_from_ground 45, are execution adaptations informed by the separate idle shadow centroid (~63.5,82.6). Separate shadow alpha 0.5 reuses the fixed-rig appearance policy. No effects, block variants or full package imported."
